{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"HEXUDON server","version":"0.1.0"},"paths":{"/api/game/difficulties":{"get":{"tags":["Admin"],"summary":"List what each map difficulty produces (ADMIN ONLY)","description":"Resolved DIFFICULTY_CONFIGS for the admin UI's board generator.\n\nThe tiers are re-tuned regularly (currently one fixed value per tier\ninstead of a window), so the create-question dialog reads them from here\ninstead of hard-coding a table in JS that would silently go stale.","operationId":"api_list_difficulties_api_game_difficulties_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}},"security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}]}},"/api/game/generate":{"post":{"tags":["Admin"],"summary":"Generate a rule-valid map preview (ADMIN ONLY)","description":"Wraps map_gen.py's MapGenerator so the admin UI can request a\nconnectivity-verified, difficulty-tuned board without duplicating that\nalgorithm in JS. Pure generation -- does not create a game; the caller\nstill POSTs the result (with a real game_id and the match's own team\nroster swapped in) to /game/init separately.","operationId":"api_generate_map_api_game_generate_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GenerateMapRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}]}},"/api/game/init":{"post":{"tags":["Admin"],"summary":"Initialize Game (ADMIN or the owning group's MANAGER)","operationId":"api_init_api_game_init_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GameInitRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}]}},"/api/game/teams":{"post":{"tags":["Admin"],"summary":"Add a team to a game mid-match (ADMIN or the owning group's MANAGER)","operationId":"api_add_team_api_game_teams_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AddTeamRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}]}},"/api/game/teams/remove":{"post":{"tags":["Admin"],"summary":"Remove a team from a game (ADMIN or the owning group's MANAGER)","description":"Drop a team from a game -- the counterpart of POST /game/teams, and the\ncall the team-manager makes when a roster edit removes a team from the\nmatch (previously nothing was cleaned up on the engine side, so the team\nkept a seat, kept appearing in every opponent's day info and kept a row in\nthe standings).\n\nWorks in EVERY status (selection, mid-match, finished) and is idempotent:\n`removed` is false when the team was not in this game. Same auth as\nPOST /game/teams -- superadmin/service token, or the manager of the group\nthat owns the game.\n\nOnly this game is touched. A plain-practice match runs one game PER TEAM\n(`{question_id}:{team_id}`); those are separate rows and the caller deletes\nthem itself via DELETE /api/game/{game_id}. Resolved days' traffic/road\nhistory is never rewritten -- see Game.remove_team.","operationId":"api_remove_team_api_game_teams_remove_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RemoveTeamRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}]}},"/api/game/group":{"post":{"tags":["Admin"],"summary":"Re-home a game to another owning group (SUPERADMIN ONLY)","description":"Update the `group_id` stored on a game -- the id `administers()` reads to\ndecide which MANAGER token counts as an admin of it.\n\nNeeded because a match can be moved between groups after its questions (and\ntherefore its games) exist: the new group's manager used to get a 403 on\nstate, board, reset, replay and delete for those games, with no way to fix\nit short of recreating them. `group_id: null` makes it an organiser game\nagain (superadmin only).\n\nSUPERADMIN / service token only: a manager must not be able to pull another\ngroup's game into its own, nor push its own out of reach.","operationId":"api_set_group_api_game_group_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SetGroupRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}]}},"/api/game/reset":{"post":{"tags":["Admin"],"summary":"Reset a game to the start so it can be replayed (ADMIN or the owning group's MANAGER)","operationId":"api_reset_api_game_reset_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResetRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}]}},"/api/game/{game_id}":{"delete":{"tags":["Admin"],"summary":"Delete a game and all its submissions (ADMIN or the owning group's MANAGER)","operationId":"api_delete_game_api_game__game_id__delete","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"game_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Game Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/game/config":{"get":{"tags":["Config"],"summary":"One-time board config for the calling team (TEAM ONLY)","description":"One-time match configuration for the calling team -- matches the\n\"Map Configuration Format Before the Match Starts\" shape from the spec.","operationId":"api_config_api_game_config_get","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"game_id","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Game Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/game/board":{"get":{"tags":["Config"],"summary":"Board/match config: map, spots, days, steps, fuel, thresholds (team or admin)","description":"Team-independent board configuration (map, spots, days, steps, fuel,\nthresholds). Unlike /game/config (team-specific) this also serves an\nadmin/spectator.\n\n**Practice matches:** there is NO game at the bare question id -- each team\nplays its own game `\"{game_id}:{team_id}\"`, all sharing the same board. As a\n**team**, just pass the bare question id: your team id is taken from the\nbearer token and the game is resolved automatically. An **admin** (no team\nid in the token) must pass the composite id explicitly, e.g.\n`1a5de476-28c5-4498-8708-e1e7efc20e3f:5`. Normal matches use the bare id.\n\n**Before the match opens** a team gets a 409 here: the board is published\nwhen play starts, not during the agent-kind window (see\n`Game.board_is_public`). An admin may read it at any time.","operationId":"api_board_config_api_game_board_get","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"game_id","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Game Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/game/agent-types":{"post":{"tags":["Play"],"summary":"Select agent patrol/refuel types before the match (TEAM ONLY)","operationId":"api_select_agent_types_api_game_agent_types_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SelectAgentTypesRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}]}},"/api/game/actions":{"post":{"tags":["Play"],"summary":"Submit a day's plan (TEAM ONLY)","operationId":"api_submit_actions_api_game_actions_post","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SubmitActionsRequest"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}},"get":{"tags":["State & History"],"summary":"Submitted plans per day (training/audit -- not part of the official ruleset)","operationId":"api_actions_history_api_game_actions_get","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"game_id","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Game Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/game/practice/actions":{"post":{"tags":["Practice"],"summary":"Submit a day in a self-paced practice game","operationId":"api_practice_actions_api_game_practice_actions_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PracticeSubmitRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}]}},"/api/game/practice/peer":{"get":{"tags":["Practice"],"summary":"Read another team's practice replay (for compare)","operationId":"api_practice_peer_api_game_practice_peer_get","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"game_id","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Game Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/game/practice/score":{"get":{"tags":["Practice"],"summary":"Read a practice game's score (for the shared leaderboard)","operationId":"api_practice_score_api_game_practice_score_get","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"game_id","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Game Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/game/practice/reset":{"post":{"tags":["Practice"],"summary":"Reset your own practice game so you can play it again","operationId":"api_practice_reset_api_game_practice_reset_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GameRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}]}},"/api/game/competitive/actions":{"post":{"tags":["Competitive Practice"],"summary":"Submit/override a day in a shared competitive-practice match","operationId":"api_competitive_actions_api_game_competitive_actions_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PracticeSubmitRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}]}},"/api/game/competitive/state":{"get":{"tags":["Competitive Practice"],"summary":"Shared competitive-practice board + ownership standings","operationId":"api_competitive_state_api_game_competitive_state_get","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"game_id","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Game Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/game/replay":{"get":{"tags":["State & History"],"summary":"Step-by-step replay of resolved days (training/audit -- not part of the official ruleset)","operationId":"api_replay_api_game_replay_get","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"game_id","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Game Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/game/day":{"get":{"tags":["Play"],"summary":"Current-day info: positions, fuel, traffic, deadline (TEAM ONLY)","operationId":"api_day_info_api_game_day_get","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"game_id","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Game Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/game/state":{"get":{"tags":["State & History"],"summary":"Full game state: teams, roads, day (team or admin)","operationId":"api_state_api_game_state_get","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"game_id","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Game Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/game/result":{"get":{"tags":["State & History"],"summary":"Ranking and per-team scoring detail (team or admin)","description":"Standings for the match. `_sync_game` first, like state/day/replay: the\nranking is what the day's simulation produced, so reading it without\nadvancing the clock served a result up to one tick (5 s) stale -- and, at\nthe end of the last day, one that did not yet include it.\n\nA competitive-practice match is scored on the shared canonical timeline,\nwhich lives in the stored standing answers, hence the `db`\n(Game.competitive_final_result).","operationId":"api_result_api_game_result_get","security":[{"HTTPBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"game_id","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Game Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}}},"components":{"schemas":{"AddTeamRequest":{"properties":{"game_id":{"type":"string","title":"Game Id"},"team_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"integer"}],"title":"Team Id"},"agents":{"items":{"type":"integer"},"type":"array","maxItems":8,"minItems":3,"title":"Agents"}},"type":"object","required":["game_id","team_id","agents"],"title":"AddTeamRequest"},"GameInitRequest":{"properties":{"game_id":{"type":"string","title":"Game Id"},"startsAt":{"type":"number","title":"Startsat"},"daySeconds":{"items":{"type":"number"},"type":"array","minItems":1,"title":"Dayseconds"},"daySteps":{"items":{"type":"integer"},"type":"array","minItems":1,"title":"Daysteps"},"map":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MapInit"},"spots":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SpotInit"},"type":"array","title":"Spots","default":[]},"fuelLimits":{"type":"integer","exclusiveMinimum":0.0,"title":"Fuellimits"},"players":{"type":"integer","minimum":1.0,"title":"Players"},"busyThreshold":{"type":"integer","title":"Busythreshold"},"jammedThreshold":{"type":"integer","title":"Jammedthreshold"},"teams":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TeamInit"},"type":"array","minItems":1,"title":"Teams"},"agent_selection_time_limit":{"type":"number","maximum":3600.0,"minimum":0.0,"title":"Agent Selection Time Limit","default":60.0},"is_practice":{"type":"boolean","title":"Is Practice","default":false},"no_reset":{"type":"boolean","title":"No Reset","default":false},"group_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Group Id"}},"type":"object","required":["game_id","startsAt","daySeconds","daySteps","map","fuelLimits","players","busyThreshold","jammedThreshold","teams"],"title":"GameInitRequest"},"GameRequest":{"properties":{"game_id":{"type":"string","title":"Game Id"}},"type":"object","required":["game_id"],"title":"GameRequest"},"GenerateMapRequest":{"properties":{"difficulty":{"type":"string","title":"Difficulty"},"teams":{"type":"integer","minimum":1.0,"title":"Teams"},"seed":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Seed"}},"type":"object","required":["difficulty","teams"],"title":"GenerateMapRequest"},"HTTPValidationError":{"properties":{"detail":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ValidationError"},"type":"array","title":"Detail"}},"type":"object","title":"HTTPValidationError"},"MapInit":{"properties":{"height":{"type":"integer","title":"Height"},"width":{"type":"integer","title":"Width"},"cells":{"items":{"items":{"type":"integer"},"type":"array"},"type":"array","title":"Cells"}},"type":"object","required":["height","width","cells"],"title":"MapInit"},"PracticeSubmitRequest":{"properties":{"game_id":{"type":"string","title":"Game Id"},"day":{"type":"integer","title":"Day"},"actions":{"items":{"items":{"type":"integer"},"type":"array"},"type":"array","title":"Actions"}},"type":"object","required":["game_id","day","actions"],"title":"PracticeSubmitRequest"},"RemoveTeamRequest":{"properties":{"game_id":{"type":"string","title":"Game Id"},"team_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"integer"}],"title":"Team Id"}},"type":"object","required":["game_id","team_id"],"title":"RemoveTeamRequest","description":"Drop a team from a game (the counterpart of AddTeamRequest). Accepts the\nid either way round because the team-manager stores numeric team ids while\nthe engine keys teams by string."},"ResetRequest":{"properties":{"game_id":{"type":"string","title":"Game Id"},"startsAt":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Startsat"}},"type":"object","required":["game_id"],"title":"ResetRequest"},"SelectAgentTypesRequest":{"properties":{"game_id":{"type":"string","title":"Game Id"},"types":{"items":{"type":"integer"},"type":"array","title":"Types"}},"type":"object","required":["game_id","types"],"title":"SelectAgentTypesRequest"},"SetGroupRequest":{"properties":{"game_id":{"type":"string","title":"Game Id"},"group_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Group Id"}},"type":"object","required":["game_id","group_id"],"title":"SetGroupRequest","description":"Re-home a game to another owning group, or to none. `group_id` is the\nteam-manager's group (school) id, and is what decides which MANAGER token\nadministers the game (api/deps.administers). None = an organiser game:\nsuperadmin only. Needed because a match can be moved between groups after\nits questions exist, which used to leave the new group's manager with a 403\non every admin verb for those games.\n\nREQUIRED, with an explicit null allowed: defaulting it would mean that a\ncaller omitting the field (a typo, an older client) silently UN-HOMES the\ngame and locks its group's manager out of it. Saying \"no group\" has to be\ndeliberate."},"SpotInit":{"properties":{"brand":{"type":"integer","title":"Brand"},"pos":{"type":"integer","title":"Pos"},"stocks":{"type":"integer","minimum":1.0,"title":"Stocks"}},"type":"object","required":["brand","pos","stocks"],"title":"SpotInit"},"SubmitActionsRequest":{"properties":{"game_id":{"type":"string","title":"Game Id"},"day":{"type":"integer","title":"Day"},"actions":{"items":{"items":{"type":"integer"},"type":"array"},"type":"array","title":"Actions"}},"type":"object","required":["game_id","day","actions"],"title":"SubmitActionsRequest"},"TeamInit":{"properties":{"team_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"integer"}],"title":"Team Id"},"agents":{"items":{"type":"integer"},"type":"array","maxItems":8,"minItems":3,"title":"Agents"}},"type":"object","required":["team_id","agents"],"title":"TeamInit"},"ValidationError":{"properties":{"loc":{"items":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"integer"}]},"type":"array","title":"Location"},"msg":{"type":"string","title":"Message"},"type":{"type":"string","title":"Error Type"},"input":{"title":"Input"},"ctx":{"type":"object","title":"Context"}},"type":"object","required":["loc","msg","type"],"title":"ValidationError"}},"securitySchemes":{"HTTPBearer":{"type":"http","description":"Paste your JWT (from the team-manager login). It is sent as 'Authorization: Bearer <token>'.","scheme":"bearer","bearerFormat":"JWT"}}},"tags":[{"name":"Admin","description":"Match setup & lifecycle (admin only): init a game, generate a map, add teams, reset to the start, delete."},{"name":"Config","description":"Board / match configuration a client reads before playing."},{"name":"Play","description":"Team gameplay: choose agent types, submit each day's plan, and read the current day's info."},{"name":"State & History","description":"Live state & standings, plus submitted-plan history and step-by-step replay (audit/training)."},{"name":"Practice","description":"Self-paced, per-team practice games: submit a day, peek at / fork another team's progress, reset."}]}